WEBVTT

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:06.340
Are you serious?!

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.390
Then it's my turn next!

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:12.870
Today, too...

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:17.900
What do you mean by that, Brother Aichi?

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.890
Kai isn't here.

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:21.960
I haven't seen him for a week.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.130
You should forget about him.

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:25.570
After all, even if you worry,

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:29.570
he'd just be like, "It's my business

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.750
where I go and what I do."

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:33.360
Kai...

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.270
He isn't even listening...

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:27.220
I've wondered where he was 
going off on his own lately...

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:29.570
Jeez!

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:34.500
What am I doing, playing 
high school detective?

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.930
Well, this is fun...

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:41.620
Charming place...

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:42.620
Whoops!

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:49.670
Uh oh! I'm getting a strong feeling 
that chaos is just around the corner...

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:51.360
But what am I gonna do?

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:59.630
I don't have any memories of him getting 
in with a bad crowd as a kid...

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:04.260
What's that?

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:09.850
Don't mind me!

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:11.710
I'm just passing through!

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:12.560
Here I go!

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:15.790
Kai!

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.690
Prepare yourself!

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:22.680
The King of Underground Fights

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:24.740
Prepare yourself!

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.040
Kai?!

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.820
Vanguard...

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:35.160
But why is he doing it in a place like this?

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:36.670
Don't tell me...

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:41.320
If I, Goldtooth Kindou, 
win, I'm takin' your deck!

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:45.140
Puttin' something on the line is 
the rule for underground fights!

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:47.880
An underground fight... Just as I thought!

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.090
And if I win, that means nothing.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:53.390
I've never seen an 
underground fight before...

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.970
The point of Vanguard is to have 
fun while playing by the rules,

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:03.690
but there are some underground fights 
where cards are bet and rules are ignored.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:10.270
Kai, what are you doing this for?

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.970
That draw was against the rules!

00:04:17.970 --> 00:04:20.110
He didn't take from the 
top, but from underneath!

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:23.340
Let's see, which card should I play?

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:25.790
Hard to make up my mind...

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.490
This one!

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:30.050
He switched cards!

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:32.860
Didn't you notice that, Kai?!

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:36.580
All's fair in an underground fight!

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:42.750
This guy!

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:45.340
A dragon is indestructible, 
its breath infinite...

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:47.640
Demonic Immortal Flame!

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:54.250
A dishonest draw, a card switch...

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.250
It seems your handicaps still weren't enough.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:04.380
He saw through the cheating but didn't 
say anything, just clobbered the guy?

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:06.480
Showoff!

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:10.440
I win. As promised, get Jun over here.

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:12.210
Jun?

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:16.680
As if! Nobody casually calls out 
the King of Underground Fights!

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:20.410
You really thought Jun would play 
against a peasant like you?!

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:25.020
If you wanna fight the King, 
you gotta beat all of us!

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:29.870
Here I go...

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:31.430
Wait!

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:33.490
Okay, okay, this is as far as it goes!

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:34.070
Miwa?

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:34.940
What?!

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:36.460
Who do you think you are?!

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:38.760
Well, I'm his companion...

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:39.860
"Companion"?!

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:44.970
Um, I think you'd be better off not getting 
involved with this guy. See, he's got connections...

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:46.110
What?!

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:49.980
His dad's a police commissioner?! 
His mom's a Chief Justice?!

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:52.480
And, and, he's actually the 
grandson of the prime minister?!

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:55.340
And on top of that, between karate 
and judo, he's at 15th dan?!

00:05:58.240 --> 00:05:59.520
Let's go home!

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:04.300
Don't ever go back to a 
place like that again!

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:06.410
I'll do as I please.

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:09.700
Ren Suzugamori, huh?

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:14.550
He has nothing to do with it.

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:18.480
You're obviously thinking about him!

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:23.470
Not that I blame you, after 
seeing that astonishing fight...

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:45.300
I guess the training camp wasn't 
enough of a challenge for him?

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:49.200
That's why he's going to underground 
fights, to search for somebody stronger...

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:51.500
Kai...

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:08.470
I heard that Kai was actually a happy 
camper before he transferred here.

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:13.000
Yeah, he supposedly totally changed 
when he moved back to this town.

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:15.990
It's like he puts out this anti-social 
aura to keep people away from him.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:17.410
What happened to him?

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.660
You got me.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:22.460
To me, you're still you.

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:24.910
You haven't changed a bit.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:27.970
Only thing that's changed is that 
you've gotten harder on yourself.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:32.040
Jeez. I can't leave him on his own.

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:42.950
Please forgive me, Jun!

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:45.280
Next time for sure, I promise...

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:48.070
Forgive you? I don't think that's possible...

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:58.670
You don't blacken the name of the 
world's strongest underground Fighter!

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:00.560
P-Please forgive me!

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:03.960
But it is interesting...

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:08.580
This man Kai, his identity aside, 
seems to have real skill.

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.330
I think I wanna meet him...

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.070
I wanna talk to Jun!

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:16.090
That guy from before!

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:17.730
How dare you...?!

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:20.390
What do you want with the King?

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:25.160
Even if he... Even if Kai comes back 
here, I don't want you to mess with him.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:26.280
What?!

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:28.050
Just what I said...

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:32.470
You're making this easy for me.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.050
Miwa?!

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:49.870
Sorry...

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:55.190
Okay, heartwarming face-to-face time is over.

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:01.790
You wanted to meet me, didn't you?

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:04.410
You're the King of Underground Fights?

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:07.010
That's right. I'm King Jun.

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:08.700
Give me back that idiot.

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:11.280
Are you talking about me?

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:12.910
Who else would it be?

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:14.340
You have a point there.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.470
There are two sides to everything.

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:22.520
The dull world above, where 
rules are followed...

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:25.700
And the underworld, where it's 
tough because there are no rules...

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:30.110
See, what really makes the world 
go round is the underworld.

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.860
And real underworld Fighters gather here.

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:36.060
Only the strong survive...

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:37.830
in this world of underworld fights.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.610
None of that has anything to do with me.

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:44.920
It seems you've got mad skillz. {you sure you want skillz to be with a z? reeeeally???}

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:49.120
How about working for me? The 
whole world could be yours.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:53.550
Take control of what's below 
and what's above will follow.

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:54.860
In other words, everything.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:58.280
I'll let you become my assistant.

00:09:58.770 --> 00:09:59.760
Nonsense.

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:01.220
What?!

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:01.900
Why, you...!

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:02.920
You're dead!

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:05.710
Nice. You don't trust anyone.

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:07.860
I'm the same way. I don't 
trust anyone either.

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:09.480
The only thing I believe in...

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:11.640
are these.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.550
These are honest.

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:15.810
You either win or lose. That's all.

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:19.020
And only the one who wins gets everything.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:21.230
If you win, he's yours.

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:23.100
But you don't stand a chance.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.530
I can see the outcome already.

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:27.140
You'll both become mine.

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:43.980
Why do I have to wear one, too?!

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:45.540
Is this...

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:49.930
a motion figure system?!

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:56.050
This is the coliseum where the King 
of Underground Fights is determined.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:59.490
It's old-fashioned, but it's always 
available for fights at this level.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:04.860
Stand up the Vanguard!

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:04.860
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:17.740
Stand up the Vanguard!

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:17.740
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:35.660
Wait a second! Why do I have to join in?!

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:38.720
You've got a box seat!

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:42.570
Apparently, this machine is a prototype 
that never made it into the world.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:50.380
It puts us right in the middle 
of the battlefield, huh?

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.410
So why am I here?

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:56.380
Oh, I just wanted to throw a little scare 
into you and make sure you don't get away.

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:59.430
It'd be boring if 
your only supporter ran away.

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:02.450
Amusing...

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:03.850
I'm going to show you the difference

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:08.170
between your "topside" Pollyanna fights 
and the essence of underworld fights.

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:09.020
I draw.

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:11.440
I ride Alluring Succubus.

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:16.880
I use the Gatekeeper's skill to Soulcharge.

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:20.440
And then one more card 
with the Succubus's skill.

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:22.620
He moves fast...

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:26.140
Two Soulcharges on the first turn...

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.550
That's our King!

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:31.190
He knows every detail of the Dark 
Irregulars' attributes and uses 'em in the fight!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:34.260
I ride Iron Tail Dragon!

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:37.920
Conroe moves.

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:39.720
I call Embodiment of Armor, Bahr!

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:43.350
I attack with Bahr!

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:49.310
I-It'd really be cruel if 
you lose like this, Kai!

00:12:53.990 --> 00:12:56.810
I can't stand it... This 
machine's got too much punch!

00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:59.150
I can see why his subordinates 
would run away...

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:01.600
I attack with Iron Tail Dragon!

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:05.670
It's my turn.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:09.280
I ride Decadent Succubus!

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:10.440
And call another one!

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:16.910
I activate the skill of my Vanguard, 
Decadent Succubus!

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:20.840
When a Dark Irregular appears in 
the rear-guard, I can Soulcharge.

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:25.380
I call March Rabbit of Nightmareland

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:27.700
and Imprisoned Fallen Angel, Saraqael!

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.280
Then again, he's going to...

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:38.290
With Succubus's skill, 
I'm Soulcharging these.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.300
Soulblast!

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:46.340
Imprisoned Fallen Angel is 
released from her bonds!

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:58.520
I attack with Fallen Angel!

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:09.970
I attack with Succubus!

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:12.260
Drive trigger check.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:18.730
Critical trigger.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:21.250
Naturally, I give the power to Iron Tail.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:25.730
I attack with Succubus, 
boosted by March Rabbit!

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:28.190
I guard with Demonic Dragon Mage, Kimnara!

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:30.880
It's your turn.

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:33.650
I ride...

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:34.810
Dragon Knight Nehalem!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.180
I move Bahr.

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:42.600
I call Gattling Claw Dragon 
and Flame Edge Dragon!

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:49.750
My next Counterblast!

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:51.930
I send Conroe off the field,

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:55.420
then take one grade 1 or lower Kagero 
unit from my deck and add it to my hand.

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:57.700
Wyvern Guard, Barri...

00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.890
You're so predictable.

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:02.680
Predictable? What do you mean?

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:05.150
With the Edel Rose he has in his hand...

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:08.540
he'll add +5000 power with a Counterblast.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:11.040
It possesses a Critical +1 skill.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:14.420
But it requires a Werwolf Sieger
in the Soul in order to activate.

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:18.620
That's why he left Werwolf in the 
Soul when he did a Soulblast.

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:22.050
Being wary about Edel Rose's skill,

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:26.020
you used Conroe's Counterblast 
to add Barri to your hand,

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:27.810
since that unit's skill 
is complete protection.

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:29.490
Wow...

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:32.850
I knew about Kai, but this 
Jun guy is something, too...

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:36.280
There's no doubt about it... even in the 
underground fights, there's an awesome Fighter.

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:41.400
I attack with Flame Edge Dragon!

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:52.680
I activate Flame Edge's skill!

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:55.770
When his attack hits, I can Soulcharge.

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:58.220
Go, Nehalem!

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:05.270
W-Wait a second!

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:08.820
I guard with Dark Queen of Nightmareland!

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.440
Check the drive trigger.

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:16.610
Draw trigger!

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:19.260
I give Gattling Claw +5000 power.

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:20.600
And then I draw.

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:33.450
I attack with Gattling Claw, boosted by Bahr!

00:16:41.570 --> 00:16:43.340
Damage trigger check.

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:46.470
How can you guys stay so calm?!

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:48.580
I'm gonna start bawling!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:50.530
He's great, too...

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:52.540
We're pretty much all small fry next to...

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:56.130
Change of strategy...

00:16:56.370 --> 00:17:00.060
As long as you've got Barri, 
Edel Rose will go to waste.

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:01.750
I ride Demon Eater!

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:06.320
I activate Eater's skill.

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:09.010
During the beginning of the 
main phase, if I Soulcharge,

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:11.330
she gains +2000 power.

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:14.440
Soulblast!

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:16.090
Fallen Angel is released from her bonds!

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:18.610
I activate Edel Rose's skill!

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:22.060
I can take a Werwolf Sieger from 
my deck and add it to my hand.

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:26.260
Fallen Angel attacks!

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:30.460
Yeah! 3 damage!

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:32.230
Next! Demon Eater!

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:34.970
I guard with Blu-ray Dracokid.

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:37.290
Drive trigger, first check...

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:38.980
Critical trigger!

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:40.870
I give all the effects to Succubus!

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:44.350
Second check.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:45.970
Next!

00:17:45.970 --> 00:17:49.030
Succubus attacks with a 
boost from March Rabbit!

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:51.190
I guard with Barri!

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:56.550
By throwing out a Kagero card from my hand,

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.250
your attack doesn't hit.

00:18:01.650 --> 00:18:03.160
It's your turn.

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:09.050
I just made him use Barri, so as long as 
I can hold on through this turn, I'll win.

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:14.250
I ride Dual Axe Archdragon!

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:15.870
Then I call Bahr!

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:19.330
Gattling Claw attacks with a boost from Bahr!

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:25.660
I attack with Dual Axe!

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:27.790
I guard with Blitzritter.

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:29.900
Check the drive trigger...

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:31.280
First...

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:33.260
Second...

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:37.080
Critical trigger!

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:39.370
I give all the effects to Flame Edge!

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:44.460
With a boost from Bahr, Flame Edge attacks!

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:46.450
I guard with Werwolf.

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:49.070
Succubus and Fallen Angel intercept!

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:03.050
That's the end of my turn.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:08.040
I can barely watch... Jun...

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:10.260
No, this is fun.

00:19:10.570 --> 00:19:14.180
When I imagine hearing you 
scream in about a minute...

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:15.970
I draw!

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:20.370
Fresh blood coveting the darkness 
and jet black flowers...

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:22.190
I ride Edel Rose!

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:26.150
I call Doreen the Thruster and Dark Queen!

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:30.570
What?! Another Edel Rose?!

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:39.830
Edel's Counterblast!

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:43.310
When a Werwolf is in the 
Soul, she gets +5000 power...

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:45.120
and Critical +1!

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:46.930
And now it's Critical 2.

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:48.490
One more time...

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:50.240
Critical 3!

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:53.140
If my attack hits you now, it'll do 3 damage!

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:54.680
I'll be the winner!

00:19:56.470 --> 00:19:59.400
First, in order to stop your intercepts,

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:03.750
Dark Queen attacks Flame Edge 
with a boost from March Rabbit.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:15.270
After you saw my first Edel 
Rose return to the deck,

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:17.950
you used Barri, which was 
a mistake, wasn't it?

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:20.780
I already had a second one then!

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:23.920
In a fight, it's more of a win 
if you fool your opponent.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.280
With a boost from Doreen,

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:30.050
Edel does a last attack!

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:34.380
I guard with Barri.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.770
Why...?!

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:42.640
Just because you had two, why would you 
arbitrarily decide that I only had one?

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:46.320
Drive trigger check!

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:49.060
No trigger...

00:20:50.670 --> 00:20:51.800
King...

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:53.190
Final Turn!

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:56.470
I call Blazing Core and Blu-ray!

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:58.530
With a boost from Blu-ray,

00:20:58.530 --> 00:21:00.270
Dual Axe attacks!

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:02.780
Check the drive trigger!

00:21:17.070 --> 00:21:20.690
I heard you were the strongest 
wielder of Dark Irregulars...

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:24.100
But I know somebody who's even stronger.

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:26.540
I lost...

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:29.280
Like you promised, let that idiot go.

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:31.100
Why, you...

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:36.180
You owe me big time for this, Kai.

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:38.310
Jeez! Use me, willya?!

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:39.620
What are you talking about?

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:44.040
Don't give me that! I'm sure you had it all 
figured out, even up to me getting captured!

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:46.090
All to drag this guy out!

00:21:46.300 --> 00:21:47.200
Excuse me?

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:50.090
Sorry, that's the kind of guy he is.

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:52.130
When did you figure it out?

00:21:52.300 --> 00:21:54.960
When we got to the table, you were laughing!

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:56.260
Was I?

00:21:56.260 --> 00:21:57.450
Jeez!

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:02.730
If I had a friend like that...

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:13.580
Kai isn't coming...?

00:22:14.280 --> 00:22:17.990
Brother, let's go home!

00:23:51.370 --> 00:23:54.150
Yo! You were waiting for Kai to come?

00:23:54.380 --> 00:23:55.160
Yes.

00:23:55.160 --> 00:23:57.420
I wanted him to see the 
deck that I put together...

00:23:57.420 --> 00:23:59.060
and I wanted to see Kai fight, too.

00:23:59.060 --> 00:24:00.690
I see. Too bad!

00:24:00.690 --> 00:24:04.160
If you'd been with me today, you would've 
felt the scene really come alive!

00:24:01.950 --> 00:24:04.990
Sorry, we've got a full house.

00:24:04.490 --> 00:24:05.460
What do you mean?

00:24:05.460 --> 00:24:06.800
Oh, nothing!

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:09.310
More importantly, it looks like the shop 
is gonna have another tournament, huh?

00:24:09.310 --> 00:24:10.130
Uh-huh!

00:24:10.130 --> 00:24:12.480
Next time: The Return of the Ninja Master!

00:24:12.480 --> 00:24:15.840
I intend to fight while picturing 
the next national tournament!

00:24:15.840 --> 00:24:17.590
I see. It sounds like fun.

00:24:17.590 --> 00:24:19.210
I mean, it'll be fun!
